flowchart LR
    A[User Request] --> B[AI Assistant]
    B --> C{Suggest or Act?}

    C -- Suggest --> D[Draft / Explain / Recommend]
    C -- Act --> E{Inside Authority Envelope?}

    E -- No --> F[Refuse or Escalate]
    E -- Yes --> G{Evidence Gate Passed?}

    G -- No --> H[Assistive Mode or Pending Review]
    G -- Yes --> I[Invoke Allowlisted Tool]

    I --> J[Record Acting Principal]
    J --> K[Create Replay Record]
    K --> L[Return Safe Outcome]
